OL,3,GNEWSAWeekly round-up: Five stories you
OL,4,Amay have missed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new dinosaur species, a ferry
OL,7,Ffarewell and a precarious police car
OL,8,Fall feature among the most-popular
OL,9,Fstories in the south of England this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FIn case you missed them, we have picked
OL,13,Ffive articles from the past seven days
OL,14,Facross Hampshire, the Isle of Wight,
OL,15,FDorset, Berkshire and Oxfordshire to
OL,16,Fkeep you up to date.
OL,18,FA cross-Channel ferry that has sailed
OL,19,Ffrom the Dorset coast for more than 30
OL,20,Fyears made its final journey on its
OL,21,Froute to France.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
